# Deliberate differences from CMakeLists.txt (checked by bazel/tools/cmake_parity):
# cmake-diff if:rclcpp_VERSION_MAJOR GREATER_EQUAL 21: Lyrical's rclcpp is 32.x; the >= 21 branch (service_msgs,
#   service introspection test) is taken unconditionally.
# cmake-diff if:COVERAGE: gcov coverage option (default OFF); use `bazel coverage` instead.
# cmake-diff unhandled:add_link_options: --coverage, under the COVERAGE option above.
# cmake-diff copt:--coverage: under the COVERAGE option above.
# cmake-diff copt:-g: under the COVERAGE option above.
# cmake-diff dep:launch_testing_ament_cmake: test_depend, but the CMakeLists adds no launch tests.
# cmake-diff unhandled:execute_process: reads <version> from package.xml for agnocast_version.hpp; done by the
#   :agnocast_version_hpp genrule.
# cmake-diff unhandled:configure_file: agnocast_version.hpp.in -> :agnocast_version_hpp genrule.
# cmake-diff unhandled:set_target_properties: OUTPUT_NAME/LIBRARY_OUTPUT_DIRECTORY of initialize_shutdown_mock;
#   the cc_shared_library is named initialize_shutdown_mock.
# cmake-diff timeout:test_integration_agnocast_only_callback_isolated_executor_agnocastlib: CMake TIMEOUT 120; Bazel tier "moderate" (300 s).
# cmake-diff timeout:test_integration_agnocast_parameter_service_agnocastlib: CMake TIMEOUT 120; Bazel tier "moderate" (300 s).
# cmake-diff timeout:test_integration_agnocast_epoll_update_agnocastlib: CMake TIMEOUT 120; Bazel tier "moderate" (300 s).
# cmake-diff timeout:test_integration_service_introspection_agnocastlib: CMake TIMEOUT 120; Bazel tier "moderate" (300 s).
# cmake-diff timeout:test_integration_agnocast_init_ok_shutdown_agnocastlib: CMake TIMEOUT 120; Bazel tier "moderate" (300 s).

